393
00:28:52,610 --> 00:28:59,290
the code in their examples,
their integrations with React

394
00:28:59,290 --> 00:29:02,650
navigation.

395
00:29:02,650 --> 00:29:05,890
And then they've got their Docs.

396
00:29:05,890 --> 00:29:11,170
And here you can search
for-- let's say you're

397
00:29:11,170 --> 00:29:16,090
interested in using their card.

398
00:29:16,090 --> 00:29:21,890
Then you can just look at how
they use their card component

399
00:29:21,890 --> 00:29:24,170
right in there in
the documentation.

400
00:29:24,170 --> 00:29:28,090
I think it should be
