456
00:33:46,150 --> 00:33:50,050
the biggest complaint I have
about that UI library before,

457
00:33:50,050 --> 00:33:54,590
because pickers are such
a common form element.

458
00:33:54,590 --> 00:33:55,770
I've run into this before.

459
00:33:55,770 --> 00:33:58,990
They do have a menu and some
other things you can substitute

460
00:33:58,990 --> 00:34:02,310
it with, but when I--

461
00:34:02,310 --> 00:34:07,990
so anyway, it tried to use
another drop down component

462
00:34:07,990 --> 00:34:12,429
and try to import it from
React Native paper at first.

463
00:34:12,429 --> 00:34:15,900
And then I called it out on
this and I was like, hey,

464
00:34:15,900 --> 00:34:17,420
this isn't working.

465
00:34:17,420 --> 00:34:22,580
And it's like, oh yeah, I
