485
00:35:43,340 --> 00:35:48,300
If you pop open
your system settings

486
00:35:48,300 --> 00:35:50,540
and if you're running
this app on Android,

487
00:35:50,540 --> 00:35:52,040
this would be your
Android settings.

488
00:35:52,040 --> 00:35:55,360
If you're running this on iOS,
that would be your iOS settings.

489
00:35:55,360 --> 00:35:56,820
I'm running on Linux.

490
00:35:56,820 --> 00:35:58,780
Windows, Mac would do this, too.

491
00:35:58,780 --> 00:36:08,000
All operating systems nowadays
have a theme picker of sorts.

492
00:36:12,610 --> 00:36:14,410
There we go.

493
00:36:14,410 --> 00:36:17,270
And they'll support a
light and a dark theme.

494
00:36:17,270 --> 00:36:19,190
And I had dark theme selected.

495
00:36:19,190 --> 00:36:21,930
If I switch to light
theme, then you

496
00:36:21,930 --> 00:36:26,530
