updates to light theme.

497
00:36:26,530 --> 00:36:31,110
And React Native provides
a use theme context hook.

498
00:36:31,110 --> 00:36:34,410
So you can hook into--
your application can hook

499
00:36:34,410 --> 00:36:37,450
into your systems
theme settings.

500
00:36:37,450 --> 00:36:40,170
So you can dynamically
or automatically

501
00:36:40,170 --> 00:36:49,610
set dark theme or light theme
based on what your user's system

502
00:36:49,610 --> 00:36:50,390
settings are.

503
00:36:50,390 --> 00:36:54,970
So you already have their
preference available that way.

504
00:36:54,970 --> 00:36:58,510
Anyway, you can find
projects on GitHub.

