some UI elements

542
00:39:40,840 --> 00:39:45,920
or having a data driven list
or some other set of data.

543
00:39:45,920 --> 00:39:51,280
And anything, any UI that
changes based on data

544
00:39:51,280 --> 00:39:56,960
